If the user asks for webinars that are available in both Live and On-demand formats:

1. Attempt to find a webinar with both a scheduled Live date and an On-demand link.
2. If no such webinar exists, display this message before showing suggestions:

📝 Just a heads-up: Not all webinars are available in both formats at the same time. Some start as live-only and are added to the On-demand library later. Let me show you the best options available now!

3. Then suggest:
   - The closest upcoming Live webinar related to their topic
   - Top relevant On-demand sessions they can watch anytime
